WEBVTT

00:11:58.496 --> 00:12:01.562
omogućeno mi je da sanjam,

00:12:01.586 --> 00:12:04.168
uprkos siromaštvu koje me je okruživalo.

00:12:05.161 --> 00:12:06.359
Zato -

00:12:06.383 --> 00:12:08.831
(Aplauz) -

00:12:08.855 --> 00:12:13.948
ako želim da poguram moje đake

00:12:13.972 --> 00:12:16.745
ka njihovim snovima
i ka njihovim ciljevima u životu,

00:12:16.769 --> 00:12:19.377
moram da ih upoznam.

00:12:20.042 --> 00:12:22.894
Zato moram da provodim vreme s njima,

00:12:22.918 --> 00:12:25.318
pa svakodnevno upravljam menzom.

00:12:25.342 --> 00:12:26.631
(Smeh)

00:12:26.655 --> 00:12:28.167
I dok sam tamo,

00:12:28.896 --> 00:12:32.914
razgovaram s njima
o duboko ličnim stvarima